  "body": "Welcome to 70 Waldorf Crescent, Orewa, a stunning three-level contemporary home that truly has it all. After years of enjoying this exceptional family home, the owners are now ready for their next chapter. With the kids starting to leave the nest, they are looking to downsize,  and free themselves up for the future - their decision has been firmly made! With a clean building report available, elevated to capture panoramic sea views and bathed in light from sunrise to sunset, this substantial 404sqm residence on a 1276sqm freehold site offers exceptional versatility for busy modern families.\r\n\r\nBoasting six bedrooms and multiple living spaces, including a legal two-bedroom self-contained granny flat, the spacious design brings together generous proportions and a natural sense of flow over three impressive levels. For extended families, teenagers, guests, working from home or simply those who want room for everyone to live comfortably, this is a home that delivers flexibility in abundance. Let’s have a look at some of the top features that await lucky new owners:\r\n\r\n* Panoramic coastal views stretching across Orewa, enjoyed from the main living, master suite and sun-drenched outdoor areas\r\n\r\n* Fully self-contained legal two-bedroom accommodation on the lower level with kitchen, bathroom and separate internal and external entrances, ideal for extended family who want to retain their independence\r\n\r\n* Spacious, light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area with pitched ceilings, gas cooking and generous storage, all positioned to take in the stunning views\r\n\r\n* Separate family room downstairs plus an office/versatile flexi-room, perfect as a home gym, work-from-home space or bonus teenage retreat\r\n\r\n* Wraparound decks and generous entertaining areas that follow the sun, with room to add a swimming pool or minor dwelling, and concept plans already drawn up\r\n\r\n* Double garage with internal entry plus plenty of additional off-street parking for extra vehicles, the boat and the campervan\r\n\r\nEnter the home on the lower level and discover a beautiful entranceway, garage, office and access to the self-contained flat. Take the stairs to the second level and you’ll find the heart of the home, where a bright open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flows seamlessly out to expansive decks. A second lounge and two generous bedrooms complete this level, giving family members plenty of room to come together when they want to and spread out when they don’t.\r\n\r\nOn the third level, the master suite becomes a true parent’s retreat, complete with breathtaking sea views, a walk-in wardrobe and luxurious ensuite. A second bedroom with its own ensuite provides another private haven for family or guests.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from the famous surf and golden sands of Orewa Beach, fantastic local schools and childcare centres, and the heart of Orewa Village with its boutique shops, cafés and eateries, the location makes everyday living incredibly easy. Auckland CBD is around a 30-minute drive in off-peak traffic, meaning you can leave the city behind and be back by the beach before you know it.\r\n\r\nThis is the one with it all: a grand yet welcoming home, elegant, modern and incredibly liveable, with the kind of space and flexibility that is becoming increasingly hard to find. If your family needs room to grow, spread out, accommodate extended family or simply enjoy life on a bigger scale, this could be exactly the home you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nThe owners are ready to move forward, so if 70 Waldorf Crescent offers the space and versatility you have been searching for, now is the time to come and see it. Call Tyler Broughton or Brooke Kennedy for more information or make a time for a private viewing to experience everything this exceptional property has to offer.",
